# Root .env for docker-compose. Copy to .env and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit .env ΓÇö only .env.example (with placeholders) belongs in git.
# Individual services also have their own .env.example files.

# ΓöÇΓöÇ Frontend (Vite build args) ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ
# Clerk publishable key ΓÇö safe to expose in frontend. Get from:
# https://dashboard.clerk.com ΓåÆ API Keys
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your_clerk_publishable_key_here

# Backend API base URL baked into the Vite bundle (what the *browser* calls).
# - Docker Compose + nginx on one host: leave unset or empty so the app uses window.location.origin
#   and hits /api/... on the same origin (see frontend/nginx.conf ΓåÆ backend).
# - Split API host (e.g. api.example.com): set https://api.example.com
# - Local dev: http://localhost:3001
# Never use http://backend:3001 ΓÇö that name exists only inside Docker and breaks in the browser.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Optional: Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (G-xxxxxxxxxx). Required at *build* time for Docker;
# add here and rebuild the frontend image. Local dev: also set in frontend/.env.
# VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# Stripe publishable key ΓÇö safe to expose in frontend. Get from:
# https://dashboard.stripe.com ΓåÆ Developers ΓåÆ API Keys
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your_stripe_publishable_key_here

# Stripe pricing table ID (Dashboard ΓåÆ Product catalog ΓåÆ Pricing tables)
# VITE_STRIPE_PRICING_TABLE_ID=prctbl_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Stripe package pricing table ID (for single-song / top-up packages)
# VITE_STRIPE_PACKAGE_PRICING_TABLE_ID=prctbl_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Full external pricing page URL (opened from in-app header button)
# VITE_FULL_PRICING_URL=https://www.burntbeats.com/pricing

# ΓöÇΓöÇ Backend ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ
# Public site origin (no trailing slash). Set on the server so stem file URLs in API JSON use https://
# when TLS terminates before Node (docker-compose passes this into the backend container).
# PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://burntbeats.com

# Optional: extra CORS + Stripe returnUrl origins (comma-separated). Built-in defaults include
# https://burntbeats.com, https://www.burntbeats.com, and common localhost URLs ΓÇö see backend/allowedOrigins.js.
# FRONTEND_ORIGINS=https://staging.example.com

# Optional: require x-api-key on API routes (server-only; never put in VITE_*).
API_KEY=

# Optional: sign per-job tokens (recommended in production).
JOB_TOKEN_SECRET=
# Dev-only auth bypass for upload/expand metering/auth checks. Keep 0 in production.
DEV_BYPASS_UPLOAD_AUTH=0

# ΓöÇΓöÇ Clerk (auth) ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ
# SECRET ΓÇö never expose this in the frontend or commit the real value.
# Get from: https://dashboard.clerk.com ΓåÆ API Keys
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=your_clerk_secret_key_here

# Webhook signing secret ΓÇö Clerk Dashboard ΓåÆ Webhooks ΓåÆ your endpoint ΓåÆ Signing Secret (whsec_...).
# Endpoint URL (same origin as the app): https://YOUR_DOMAIN/api/clerk/webhook
# Required in Docker/production if you use welcome signup tokens (user.created).
# CLERK_WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET=whsec_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ΓöÇΓöÇ Stripe (payments) ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ
# SECRET ΓÇö never expose this in the frontend or commit the real value.
# Get from: https://dashboard.stripe.com ΓåÆ Developers ΓåÆ API Keys
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=your_stripe_secret_key_here

# Webhook signing secret ΓÇö Dashboard (prod) or Stripe CLI (local). Local: stripe login, then
#   bash scripts/stripe-listen.sh   (or: cd backend && npm run stripe:listen)
# Paste the printed whsec_... here.
# Endpoint URL (same origin as the app): https://YOUR_DOMAIN/api/billing/webhook
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_stripe_webhook_secret_here

# Stripe account ID ΓÇö not currently read by backend code (Dashboard reference only).
# STRIPE_ACCOUNT_ID=acct_xxxxxxxxxxxx

# ΓöÇΓöÇ Stripe price / product IDs ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ
# Create products at https://dashboard.stripe.com ΓåÆ Products

# Studio Quality Plan
STRIPE_PRICE_ID_STUDIO=price_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
STRIPE_PRODUCT_ID_STUDIO=prod_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Premium Monthly
STRIPE_PRICE_ID_PREMIUM=price_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
STRIPE_PRODUCT_ID_PREMIUM=prod_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Basic Monthly
STRIPE_PRICE_ID_BASIC=price_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
STRIPE_PRODUCT_ID_BASIC=prod_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Top-Up Pack
STRIPE_PRICE_ID_TOPUP=price_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
STRIPE_PRODUCT_ID_TOPUP=prod_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Single Song Pack ΓÇö one-time $0.99 purchase (mode: "payment", not subscription)
STRIPE_PRICE_ID_SINGLE=price_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ΓöÇΓöÇ Sentry APM (error tracking + performance monitoring) ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ
# Each service uses its own DSN (Sentry project). Leave unset to disable monitoring (graceful degradation).
# Get DSNs from: https://sentry.io ΓåÆ Settings ΓåÆ Projects ΓåÆ Client Keys (DSN)

# Backend Sentry DSN (Node.js/Express project)
# SENTRY_DSN=https://examplePublicKey@o0.ingest.sentry.io/0

# Stem service Sentry DSN (Python/FastAPI project ΓÇö separate from backend)
# SENTRY_DSN_STEM=https://examplePublicKey@o0.ingest.sentry.io/1

# Frontend Sentry DSN (React project ΓÇö baked into the Vite bundle at build time)
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://examplePublicKey@o0.ingest.sentry.io/2

# Environment tag for all services (production, staging, development). Default: production.
# SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=production

# Frontend environment override (uses SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT if unset). Baked in at build time.
# VITE_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=production

# Release tag ΓÇö typically the git SHA or version tag. Correlates errors with deployments.
# SENTRY_RELEASE=

# Frontend release override (uses SENTRY_RELEASE if unset). Baked in at build time.
# VITE_SENTRY_RELEASE=

# Source map upload credentials (required at frontend build time for readable stack traces).
# Get from: https://sentry.io ΓåÆ Settings ΓåÆ Auth Tokens
# SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=sntrys_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# SENTRY_ORG=your-sentry-org
# SENTRY_PROJECT=your-frontend-project
